<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Verify your Klambie account</title>
    <style>
      * { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI',
      Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue',
      sans-serif; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body style='margin: 0; padding: 0'>
    <main style='padding: 5%'>
      <center
        style='width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #ffffff'
      >
        <table
          style='
            margin: 0 auto;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            border-spacing: 0;
            color: #333333;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
          '
          width='100%'
        >
          <tr>
            <td
              style='
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 16px;
                font-weight: 400;
                padding: 5% 5% 2.5% 5%;
              '
            >
              <img
                src='https://i.postimg.cc/9Qm9HXgq/klambie.png'
                alt='Logo Klambie'
                style='max-width: 80px; height: auto'
              />
              <h1>Hi Really Real People, Welcome to Klambie!</h1>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style='padding: 2.5% 5%; font-size: 16px'>
              <h3 style='margin-top: 0'>Hello {{name}},</h3>
              <p>
                Thanks for registering an account with Klambie! In order to
                start using Klambie, you need to verify your email. Once it's
                done you will be able to start shopping!
              </p>

              <div style='text-align: center; padding: 2.5%'>
                <a
                  href='{{vertificationUrl}}'
                  style='
                    background-color: #9a3412;
                    color: #ffffff;
                    padding: 15px 30px;
                    text-decoration: none;
                    border-radius: 10px;
                    display: inline-block;
                    font-weight: 600;
                  '
                  target='_blank'
                >Verify your email</a>
              </div>

              <p style='color: #666666'>
                Can't click the button above? Copy and paste this link into your
                browser.<br />
                <a
                  href='{{vertificationUrl}}'
                  style='color: #9a3412; font-size: 14px'
                >{{vertificationUrl}}</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td
              style='
                padding: 2.5% 5%;
                text-align: center;
                background-color: #1b1a1e;
                color: #666666;
                font-size: 14px;
                border-radius: 0px 0px 10px 10px;
              '
            >
              <div>
                <a href='https://www.instagram.com' target='_blank'><img
                    style='width: 30px; height: 30px; margin: 0 10px'
                    src='https://img.icons8.com/?size=100&id=eRJfQw0Zs44S&format=png&color=666666'
                    alt='Instagram'
                  />
                </a>
                <a href='https://www.facebook.com' target='_blank'><img
                    style='width: 30px; height: 30px; margin: 0 10px'
                    src='https://img.icons8.com/?size=100&id=118468&format=png&color=666666'
                    alt='Facebook'
                  /></a>
                <a href='https://www.youtube.com' target='_blank'><img
                    style='width: 30px; height: 30px; margin: 0 10px'
                    src='https://img.icons8.com/?size=100&id=36908&format=png&color=666666'
                    alt='Youtube'
                  /></a>
              </div>
              <p>
                You're receiving this email because you have registered an
                account in Klambie. If you are not sure why you`re receiving
                this, please contact us by replying on this email.
              </p>
              <p>&copy; 2026 Klambie. All rights reserved.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </center>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>